  "details": "Repro steps:\n1. Start VRChat in desktop mode and join a world with a pickup (e.g. https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_100a0fb3-1e66-4cd8-b0cb-47353f10de88 has one to the lower left of the big monitor)\n2. Pick up the pickup in desktop and try to use u/i/o/j/k/l to rotate. It will not rotate.\n3. Join a second player to the instance.\n4. u/i/o/j/k/l works on the first player's client now, and will continue to work until changing instances.",
